 HUNTER=recipe('Set the pet\'s target and choose a firing position beyond the pursuer\'s melee range.',{basic('Concussive Shot','The pursuer can be slowed and the shot is ready and in range.','Slow it before widening the gap.'),basic('Wing Clip','The pursuer has reached melee, can be slowed, and you can use Wing Clip safely.','Apply the close-range slow, then leave melee.'),basic('Arcane Shot','You are moving at valid ranged distance and the shot is ready.','Deal damage without stopping the kite.')},'Do not stop to cast Aimed Shot while the pursuer is about to reach you.'),
 ROGUE=recipe('Choose an escape route and preserve Energy for the control action.',{basic('Gouge','The pursuer is eligible, position requirements are met, and periodic damage will not immediately break it.','Use the short control window to leave melee.'),basic('Sprint','The safe route is clear and you need separation.','Run while the pursuer cannot reconnect.'),step(nil,'You have created separation but cannot safely re-enter melee.','Stay out until the danger passes; do not spend offensive cooldowns from out of range.','Kiting deliberately sacrifices melee damage to survive.')},'Do not break your own Gouge with an immediate attack before creating distance.'),
 WARRIOR=recipe('Choose a path that does not drag enemies across allies.',{basic('Hamstring','The melee pursuer is in range and can be slowed.','Apply the slow before moving away.'),basic('Piercing Howl','Several nearby pursuers can be affected and you have the resource to use it.','Slow the nearby group before opening distance.','Piercing Howl'),step(nil,'The slow has landed and you can move without exposing allies.','Move along the safe route. Use a defensive if the enemy reconnects.','The slow creates time; remaining in melee wastes it.')},'Do not kite a tanked pack into the healer\'s position.'),
 PALADIN=recipe('Choose a safe route and identify removable movement restrictions.',{basic('Hammer of Justice','The pursuer can be stunned and is in range.','Use the stun window to separate.'),basic('Blessing of Freedom','A removable movement restriction prevents your escape and the current effect can remove or prevent it.','Restore movement before trying to run.'),step(nil,'You are free to move and the pursuer is controlled.','Move to the safe position instead of starting another melee attack or Holy Light.','Spend the control window on separation.')},'Do not rely on Hammer of Justice against a stun-immune target.'),
 PRIEST=recipe('Choose a route toward friendly support and away from unpulled enemies.',{basic('Psychic Scream','Nearby pursuers can be feared and their escape paths will not create another pull.','Create separation rather than trying to heal through uninterrupted melee.'),basic('Power Word: Shield','You can receive the shield and need protection while moving.','Absorb incoming damage during the escape.'),step(nil,'The pursuer is controlled and the route is clear.','Run to safety or friendly help, then stop to heal only when a cast can finish safely.','Do not spend the fear window standing beside the enemy.')},'Do not fear enemies into another pack.'),
 WARLOCK=recipe('Check the enemy\'s fear eligibility and choose a route that does not pull another pack.',{basic('Death Coil','The pursuer can be affected and Death Coil is ready and in range.','Create a short escape/recovery window.'),basic('Fear','The pursuer can be feared, the path is safe, and you have time to complete the cast.','Control the enemy before opening distance.'),basic('Corruption','You are moving, Corruption is instant in your current setup, and the pursuer needs a fresh application.','Contribute damage without stopping the escape.')},'Do not start a Fear hard cast if the pursuer will kill you before it finishes.')
